    {
      "index": 2,
      "type": "question",
      "text": "Oracleの移行で全量コピーだけが成功したら、どこを調べますか。",
      "audio": "interview-question-02.mp3",
      "audioHash": "a49a2b7c81e9963886daf9aa1664b3adf12e48b024bc2fca35c90005192e5710",
